===Abyss jewels===
The [[Corrupted Gaze]] Atlas passive skill can cause Abyss jewels to drop corrupted with 5 or 6 affixes. [[Allflame crafting]] with {{il|Merrick's Ducat}} adds an explicit modifier to an Abyss jewel, even if it has 4 explicit mods, and corrupts it.
